#: ../../source/product-overview/desktop.rst:-1
msgid "Mattermost Desktop App"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱"

#: ../../source/product-overview/desktop.rst:2
msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "데스크톱"

#: ../../source/product-overview/desktop.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Mattermost desktop app is available for Linux, Mac, and Windows "
"operating systems. The Desktop App supports all the features of the web "
"experience. Desktop users can additionally :doc:`connect to multiple "
"Mattermost servers </end-user-guide/preferences/connect-multiple-"
"workspaces>` and :ref:`keep multiple workspace contexts open at once "
"<end-user-guide/preferences/connect-multiple-workspaces:open multiple "
"workspace contexts>` from a single interface, navigate using "
":ref:`keyboard shortcuts <end-user-guide/collaborate/keyboard-"
"shortcuts:navigation in the desktop app>`, and :doc:`customize their "
"desktop user experience </end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-"
"app-experience>`."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱은 Linux, Mac, Windows 운영 체제에서 사용할 수 있습니다. "
"데스크톱 앱은 웹 환경의 모든 기능을 지원합니다. 데스크톱 사용자는 추가로 하나의 "
"인터페이스에서 :doc:`여러 OKR.BEST 서버에 연결 </end-user-guide/preferences"
"/connect-multiple-workspaces>`\\ 하고 :ref:`여러 워크스페이스 컨텍스트를 동시에 "
"열어 둘 <end-user-guide/preferences/connect-multiple-workspaces:open "
"multiple workspace contexts>` 수 있으며, :ref:`키보드 단축키 <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/keyboard-shortcuts:navigation in the desktop app>`\\ 로 "
"이동하고 :doc:`데스크톱 사용자 경험을 커스터마이징 </end-user-guide"
"/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience>`\\ 할 수 있습니다."

